    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p>Manual Triggers can be added to any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Explosive\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Explosive\">Explosive</a>, including <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mines\" title=\"Mines\">Mines</a>. As with a Timer, the Manual Trigger must be set with a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mechanics\" title=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</a> check. If the check is successful, you can detonate the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Explosive\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Explosive\">Explosive</a> using the Trigger as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a> from anywhere within 30 squares of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Explosive\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Explosive\">Explosive</a>. </p>",
